%% Diagram: Architecture as Code – Technical Structure
%% Shows the layered relationship between declarative definitions,
%% automation pipelines, and governance controls.
flowchart TB
    Defs["Layer 1: Definitions<br/>Models, code, diagrams"]:::geon-muted
    VCS["Version control<br/>Single source of truth"]:::geon-primary
    Pipe["Layer 2: Pipelines<br/>Build, test, deploy"]:::geon-accent
    Gov["Layer 3: Governance<br/>Policy, audit, reports"]:::geon-highlight
    Artifacts["Published artefacts"]:::geon-pattern

    Defs --> VCS
    VCS --> Pipe
    Pipe --> Gov
    Pipe --> Artifacts
    Gov -. "Enforce" .-> Pipe
